#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kapman; is a clone of the well known game <application>Pac-Man</"
"application>. You must go through the levels escaping ghosts in a maze. You "
"lose a life when a ghost eats you, but you can eat the ghosts for a few "
"seconds when eating an energizer. You win points when eating pills, "
"energizers, and bonus, and you win one life for each 10,000 points. When you "
"have eaten all the pills and energizers of a level, you go to the next "
"level, and the player and ghost speeds increase. The game ends when you have "
"lost all your lives."
msgstr ""
"&kapman; je klon dobro poznate igre <application>Pac-Man</application>. "
"Morate ići kroz levele da pobjegnete duhovima u labirintu. Gubite život kada "
"vas duh pojede, ali možete pojesti dugove za nekoliko sekundi kada jedete "
"baterije. Dobijate poene kada jedete tablete, baterije, i bonus, i dobijate "
"život za svakih 10000 poena. Kada pojete sve pilule i baterije na levelu, "
"idete na sljedeći level, a brzina dugova i igrača se povećava. Igra završava "
"kada izgubite sve živote."

