#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "Kako igrati"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objective:"
msgstr "Cilj:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Go through the levels by eating all pills and energizers."
msgstr "Idete kroz levele jedući sve pilule i baterije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kapman; will load level one once you start the game. To start the game, "
"press an arrow key. You move straight ahead without pressing any key. To "
"turn, press an arrow key. You should not turn at the last moment, but "
"anticipate and you will turn as soon as possible. To eat a pill, an "
"energizer, a bonus, or even a ghost, you must get in touch with it. When all "
"the pills and energizers have been eaten, you move to the next level."
msgstr ""
"&kapman; će učitati level jedan kada pokrenete igru. Da biste pokrenuli "
"igru, pritisnite strelicu. Krećete se naprijed bez pritiska tipke. Da "
"skrenete pritisnite strelicu. Ne trebate skretati u zadnjem trenutnu, nego "
"predvidite i skrenit ćete što je prije moguće. Da biste pojeli tabletu, "
"bateriju, bonus, ili čak duga, morate ih dodirnuti. Kada su pojedene sve "
"tablete i baterije, prelazite na sljedeći nivo."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules, Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Pravila igre, Strategije i savjeti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Pravila"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To move to the next level, you must eat every pill and energizer in the maze."
msgstr ""
"Da pređete na sljedeći nivo, morate pojesti svaku tabletu i bateriju u "
"labirintu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A bonus appears when you have eaten 1/3 and 2/3 of the pills and energizers. "
"It disappears after a few seconds (10 seconds at the first level, but it "
"decreases as the level increases) if you have not eaten it."
msgstr ""
"Bonus se pojavljuje kada pojedete 1/3 i 2/3 tableta i baterija. Nestaje "
"nakon nekoliko sekundi (10 sekundi na prvom levelu, ali se smanjuje kako se "
"nivo povećava) ako ga niste pojeli."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As the level increases, both your speed and the ghosts speed increase. "
"However, the ghosts will be more and more faster than you."
msgstr ""
"Kako se level povećava, vaša brzina i brzina dugova raste. Međutim, dugovi "
"će biti sve brži i brži nego vi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you get in touch with a ghost, you lose a life, and the current level "
"restarts (but the eaten pills and energizer do not reappear)."
msgstr ""
"Ako dodirnete duga, izgubit ćete život, i trenutni nivo se restartuje ( ali "
"pojedene tablete i baterije se ne pojavljuju pnovo )."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are in the line of sight of a ghost (that is to say : no wall between "
"the ghost, and both of you go to the same direction), the ghost will hunt "
"you. Otherwise, the ghosts have a random moving."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste na vidiku duga ( ovo znači : nema zida između duga, i oboje idete u "
"istom pravcu, duh će vas proganjati. Inače, duhovi se nasumično kreću."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you eat an energizer, the ghosts slow down and you can eat them. If you "
"eat a ghost, it goes back to its home and its normal behaviour. After a few "
"seconds (10 seconds at the first level, but it decreases as the level "
"increases), the ghosts that have not been eaten go back to their normal "
"behaviour."
msgstr ""
"Kada pojedete bateriju, duhovi usporavaju i možete ih pojesti. Ako pojedete "
"duga, on ide nazad do njegove kuće i normalnog ponašanja. Nakon nekoliko "
"sekundi (10 sekundi na prvom levelu, ali smanjuje se vrijeme kako se nivo "
"povećava), duhovi koji nisu pojedeni vraćaju se normalnom ponašanju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid "You win points when eating an item:"
msgstr "Dobijate poene kada pojedete predmet:"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "Item values"
msgstr "Vrijednost predmeta"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pill"
msgstr "Tableta"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "10 points"
msgstr "10 poena"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Energizer"
msgstr "Baterija"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "20 points"
msgstr "20 poena"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bonus"
msgstr "Bonus"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "Current level * 100 points"
msgstr "Trenutni nivo* 100 poena"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ghost"
msgstr "Duh"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It depends on the number of ghosts you have eaten since the last energizer "
"was eaten:"
msgstr ""
"U zavisnosti od broja duhova koje ste pojeli od kada je zadnja baterija bila "
"pojedena:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "1st ghost: 100 points"
msgstr "Prvi duh: 100 poena"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "2nd ghost: 200 points"
msgstr "Drugi duh: 200 poena"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "3rd ghost: 400 points"
msgstr "Treći duh: 400 poena"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid "4th ghost: 800 points"
msgstr "Četvri duh: 800 poena"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "You get a life more every 10,000 points you win."
msgstr "Dobijate novi život na svakih 10000  osvojenih poena."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Strategije i savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To eat an item, you must get it touch with its center, not only a few "
"pixels. So be sure you have really eaten what you wanted, before turning "
"back."
msgstr ""
"Da biste pojeli predmet, morate doći u dodir sa njegovim centrom, ne samo "
"nekoliko piksela. Pa budite sigurni da ste stvarno pojeli šta ste htjeli, "
"prije okretanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At first levels, the bonus does not make a lot of points and ghosts are not "
"very fast, so you should concentrate on eating the most ghosts that you can."
msgstr ""
"Na prvim nivoima, bonus ne pravi mnogo poena i duhovi nisu jako brzi, pa "
"biste se trebali koncentrisati da pojedete što više duhova možete."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After about ten levels, the ghosts are faster and the bonus makes more "
"points, so you should try to eat the bonus when possible. Do not hesitate to "
"eat an energizer when you can see the bonus, to not be disturbed by the "
"ghosts."
msgstr ""
"Nakon oko deset niova, duhovi su brži i bonus pravi više poena, pa biste "
"trebali pokušati da pojedete bonus kada je moguće. Ne oklijevajte da "
"pojedete bateriju kada vidite bonus, da ne budete ometeni od strane duhova."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the same way, you should try to eat an energizer before going to the "
"dangerous places (like near the ghost home)."
msgstr ""
"Na isti način, trebali biste pokušati pojesti bateirju prije nego što odete "
"u opasno mjesto ( kao blizu kuće duhova)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the ghosts are too fast, you should avoid to eat them if you are near "
"their home. They could go back faster than you think."
msgstr ""
"Kada su duhovi prebrzi, trebali biste izbjegavati da ih pojedete blizu "
"njihove kuće. Mogli bi se vratiti brže nego što mislite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Do not hesitate to stay in the same place for a few seconds, waiting for the "
"ghosts to go far away from the place you need to go."
msgstr ""
"Ne oklijevajte da ostanete na istom mjestu nekoliko sekundi, čekajući da "
"duhovi odu daleko od mjesta gdje trebate ići."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can find cheatcodes from the source code. But be careful: if you make a "
"new high score but have cheated, your high score will not be registered."
msgstr ""
"Možete naći kodove za varanje u izvornom kodu. Ali budite oprezni: ako "
"napravite novi rekord varajući, rekord neće biti registrovan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "Last but not least: Have fun !"
msgstr "Zadnji ali ne nevažan: Zabavite se!"

