"Adjusts the game difficulty to <guimenuitem>Easy</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem> or <guimenuitem>Hard</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Podešava težinu igre na <guimenuitem>Lako</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Srednje</guimenuitem> ili <guimenuitem>Teško</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
