#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid "Questions and Answers"
msgstr "Pitanja i odgovori"

#. Tag: chapter
#: index.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid "&reporting.bugs; &updating.documentation;"
msgstr "&reporting.bugs; &updating.documentation;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "Želim da promijenim izgled igre. Mogu li?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can select the &kapman; theme in the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Kapman...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> dialog. "
"See the <link linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> chapter "
"for more details."
msgstr ""
"Možete odabrati &kapman; temu u <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši Kapman...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"dijalog. pogledajte <link linkend=\"configuration\">Konfiguracija igre</"
"link> odjeljak za više detalja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I skip a level?"
msgstr "Mogu li prekočiti level?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are two ways to change the current level. In both cases, you will be "
"considered as a cheater and you will not be able to register to the high "
"scores. The first way is using a cheatcode. I let you find it. The other way "
"is selecting the level you want from the <menuchoice><guimenu>Game</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Change Level</guimenuitem></menuchoice> dialog. See the "
"<link linkend=\"menu\">Menubar</link> section for more details."
msgstr ""
"Postoje dva načina da promijenite trenutni level. U oba slučaja, bit ćete "
"smatrani varalicom i nećete biti u mogućnosti da registrujete rekord. Prvi "
"način je korištenje koda za varanje. Pustit ću vas da ga sami nađete. Drugi "
"način je odabir levela koji želite iz <menuchoice><guimenu>Igra</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Promijeni level</guimenuitem></menuchoice>  dijaloga. "
"Pogledajte <link linkend=\"menu\">Meni traka</link> odjeljak za više detalja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I change default keyboard shortcuts?"
msgstr "Mogu li promijeniti zadane prečice tastature?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is not possible for now. But will be a new feature in a future version of "
"&kapman;. See the <link linkend=\"keybindings\">Default Keybindings</link> "
"section for more details."
msgstr ""
"Nije moguće za sada. Ali bit će novi dodatak budućoj verziji &kapmana;-a. "
"Pogledajte <link linkend=\"keybindings\">Zadane prečice</link> za više "
"detalja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""
"Moram da napustim igru, ali još nisam završio. Da li mogu da snimim napredak?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can not, and it is deliberate. We think that the game would be too easy "
"if you could save the game and reload it as you lose your lives."
msgstr ""
"Ne možete, i to je namjerno. Mi mislimo da bi igra bila prelaga ako biste "
"spremili igru pa je učitate kada izgubite živote."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid "How can I get more lives?"
msgstr "Kako mogu dobiti više života?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are two ways to get lives. The first one is using a cheatcode. I let "
"you find it. The other way is winning points. Every 10,000 points, you get a "
"life more. See the <link linkend=\"rules\">Rules</link> section for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Postoje dva načina za dobijanje života. Prvi je korištenjem koda za varanje. "
"Pustit ću vas da ga sami nađete. Drugi način je osvajanjem poena. Svakih "
"10000 poena, daje vam novi život. Pogledajte <link linkend=\"rules"
"\">Pravila</link> odjeljak za više detalja."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can select the theme you want to play &kapman;. To do that, select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Kapman...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. The &kapman; configuration dialog (see below) "
"appears and you can then select the theme. It is immediately changed on "
"validating your choice, no need to restart the game. You can click on the "
"<guibutton>Defaults</guibutton> button to restore the default theme."
msgstr ""
"Možete odabrati temu koju želite pri igranju &kapman;-a. Da to uradite "
"odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši "
"Kapman...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. kapman; konfiugracijski dijalog "
"( pogledajte ispod ) se pojavljuje i možete odabrati temu. Trenutno je "
"promijenjena pri validaciji izbora, pa nema potrebe za restartovanjem igre. "
"Možete kliknuti na  <guibutton>Zadano</guibutton> dugme da povratite zadanu "
"temu."

